# violence_update walks char_list by the next pointer it took before each fighter's round. New characters go at the
# head of char_list, so making a duck (3124) and then connecting Rambler (2) puts Rambler just before the duck, and
# after them a drunk (3064, made earlier) and Decimus (10, connected first). In the temple (3001), with Hassan and
# Smokegod (60), Decimus fights the drunk and Rambler the duck. In the pulse whose round kills the duck, the C's next
# pointer is the freed duck, whose next is recycle.c's free list: the loop ends there, so Decimus and the drunk get
# no round that pulse (sic, #75). The next pulse of violence, they fight on.
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@mob 3064 3001
@mob 3124 3001
@connect ram
Rambler
psswrd
@return
@return
@as dec
kill drunk
@as ram
kill duck
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
@pulse 12
@state
